1) For more information on Illusions, see Section 7.1.27..
2) If more than one of the options may be chosen, the same option may be chosen more than once. For example, if two options were available, the range for an Illusion could be doubled to 100' and then doubled again to 200'.
3) Illusions created with spells off of this list are "real" in as much as they can be seen and/or heard. Detecting that an illusion is just an illusion can only be accomplished through spells or through the use of conflicting senses (i.e., you reach out to touch it and don't feel anything). OPEN MENTALISM 4.1.8 ILLUSIONS
